high 2850 (bar 114).", "Bars 1-7 close 2006.31, 2006.06, 1859.02, 1813.04, 1731, 1581.32, 1568.55 (seven consecutive lower closes); bar 7 spans 1599.27-1368.42 and closes 1568.55, well above its low.", "Bars 8-44 stay inside 1512.91 (bar 27 low) and 1845.09 (bar 16 high); no close exceeds 1845.09, and lows after bar 27 rise (1551.6, 1560.05, 1597.72, 1694.74, 1751.07).", "Bars 45-58 print higher highs 1891.66, 1944.39, 1954.36, 1974.46 with pullbacks only to 1848.82/1850.53; bars 62-80 then hold a roughly 19-bar band above 1821.49 (bar 65 low).", "Bars 81-83 are three large bull trend bars closing 2252.16, 2326.32, 2515.3; bar 81 opens at the prior close 1916.51 and bar 83 reaches 2771.", "Bars 84-107 spend 24 bars inside 2357.18 (bar 95 low) and 2557.46 (bar 89 high); upside attempts fail to hold: bar 104 high 2680 closes 2514.72, bar 107 high 2609.02 closes 2514.07.", "Bar 108 prints 2358.62, slightly above the 2357.18 low (bar 95); bars 111-114 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.9, 2775.61, all above the 2557.46 range top.", "Bars 115-120 overlap between 2633.31 (bar 117 low) and 2786.81 (bar 116 high), closing 2752.43, 2684.16, 2686.59, 2690.56, 2694.96, 2685.9; no print above 2850 since bar 114.", "Last bar (120) 2694.96/2718.83/2668.55/2685.9 is a small-range, doji-like bar fully contained inside bar 116's 2752.43-2641.37 range."], "phase": "channel", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Opening bear leg: seven lower closes with the largest bear bar last (1599.27-1368.42, close 1568.55), leaving a long lower tail above the window low 1368.42 - a selling-climax shape at the bottom.", "end_time_ms": 1780704000000, "kind": "climax", "lower_boundary": "1368.42", "start_time_ms": 1780185600000, "upper_boundary": "2035.94"}, {"description": "Broad two-sided range after the low: about 37 overlapping bars capped by 1845.09 (bar 16) and floored by 1512.91 (bar 27); later bars inside it make successively higher lows.", "end_time_ms": 1783900800000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "1512.91", "start_time_ms": 1780790400000, "upper_boundary": "1845.09"}, {"description": "Rising leg from 1773.57 to 1974.46 (bar 58) with higher highs and only shallow pullbacks, then a flattening ~19-bar base that holds above 1821.49 before the spike.", "end_time_ms": 1787097600000, "kind": "channel", "lower_boundary": "1773.57", "start_time_ms": 1783987200000, "upper_boundary": "1974.46"}, {"description": "Bull spike of three large trend bars (bars 81-83) closing 2252.16, 2326.32, 2515.3 and running 1905.63 to 2771.", "end_time_ms": 1787270400000, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "1905.63", "start_time_ms": 1787097600000, "upper_boundary": "2771"}, {"description": "Post-spike trading range of 24 bars between 2357.18 (bar 95) and 2557.46 (bar 89); two upside attempts (bar 104 high 2680, bar 107 high 2609.02) closed back inside.", "end_time_ms": 1789344000000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2357.18", "start_time_ms": 1787356800000, "upper_boundary": "2557.46"}, {"description": "Bull breakout leg: bar 108 holds a higher low 2358.62, then bars 111-114 close 2612.02, 2632.98, 2642.9, 2775.61, accepting above the 2557.46 range top and printing the window high 2850.", "end_time_ms": 1789948800000, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789430400000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Six-bar tight pause just under the high: bars 115-120 overlap between 2633.31 and 2786.81 with flat closes near 2685-2752, holding above the old 2557.46 range top.", "end_time_ms": 1790467200000, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1790035200000, "upper_boundary": "2786.81"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "D1", "transition_conditions": ["Two consecutive closes above 2786.81 (bar 116 high) would confirm the pause resolved upward and extend the bull leg beyond the 2850 high.", "A close back below 2557.46 (post-spike range top) would mark the breakout as failed and shift the read toward trading-range.", "A close below 2358.62 / 2357.18 (bars 108 / 95 lows) would break the higher-low sequence and weaken the bull-trend classification.", "Bars continuing to overlap between 2633.31 and 2786.81 with ranges near 50-100 points keep the phase a tight pause (range-like) rather than a spike.", "A decisive close below 2633.31 while holding under 2786.81 would make the six-bar pause the dominant structure and raise the case for transition-unclear."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}, "H4": {"context": {"always_in": "short", "always_in_relevance": "low", "breakout_mode": true, "confidence": "medium", "decision_time_ms": 1790567999999, "directional_pressure": "bear", "evidence_against": ["40 bars without a new high after 2850 and declining swing highs (2804.59, 2786.81, 2740.42) show the trend has stopped making progress.", "Net change over bars 97-119 is +2.84 points (close 2647.9 to 2650.74): the recent market is flat and two-sided, with alternating overlapping bars rather than trend bars.", "Bar 119 closes 2650.74 below the 2665.14 tight-range floor and below every close since bar 112 (2694.96, 2695.79, 2717.24, 2709.21, 2688.8, 2690.44, 2685.9): a fresh, if unconfirmed, bear breakout attempt at the bottom of the wider range.", "A strict bar count favors a range label: roughly 45 bars (0-44) plus 40 bars (80-119) are two-sided versus about 35 bars of directional leg (45-79).", "The recent advance into 2717.24 (bar 114) was made on the smallest volume cluster of the window (bars 106-118, mostly 1.9M-4.1M), which is supplied context suggesting no expansion behind the highs."], "evidence_for": ["Spike-and-channel bull structure: bars 59-63 give five consecutive bull closes from 2446.22 to 2636.28, then bars 64-79 form a channel of overlapping bars with rising pullback lows (2568.16 at bar 73, 2641.7 at bar 77) into the 2850 high; this is a bull trend that can resume, not a completed reversal.", "The higher-low sequence holds: 2358.62 (bar 45) -> 2370.54 (bar 51) -> 2568.16 (bar 73) -> 2633.31 (bar 97); bar 119's low 2643.44 remains above the bar 97 range floor and the whole window base.", "No close in the 40 bars since the spike high (bars 80-119) is below 2647.9 (bar 97), so the post-spike range has held on a closing basis and sits on top of the 2358.62-2550 area from bars 0-59.", "The 40-bar range is positioned directly above the bull spike's 2636.28 close area and above the bar 45-59 base, which fits a consolidation/bull-flag location after a strong leg rather than a failed trend."], "missing_information": [], "observations": ["Window of 120 closed H4 bars (1788840000000 to 1790567999999): window low 2358.62 (bar 45), window high 2850 (bar 79).", "Bars 59-63 are five consecutive higher closes (2476.78, 2488.06, 2507.31, 2578.6, 2636.28) from open 2446.22 to close 2636.28 (+7.8%): a bull spike.", "From bar 45 low 2358.62 to bar 79 high 2850 the leg is +20.8% over 35 bars, with pullback lows at 2568.16 (bar 73) and 2641.7 (bar 77), both above prior swing lows (spike-then-channel sequence).", "Since the 2850 high, bars 80-119 have not traded above 2804.59 (bar 82); swing highs step down after bar 82: 2804.59 (bar 82) -> 2786.81 (bar 90) -> 2740.42 (bar 103).", "Bars 104-118 are 15 overlapping small bars inside a 2665.14-2721.75 envelope (56.61 points, about 2.1% of price), with most of those bars ranging under 30 points versus 40-80 points during the bull leg.", "Bar 119 (open 2685.9, high 2697.14, low 2643.44, close 2650.74) closes in the bottom 14% of its 53.7-point range, below the lows and closes of bars 112-118, and its range is roughly three times the ~18-point average range of bars 105-118.", "Since bar 114 (close 2717.24) closes are 2709.21, 2688.8, 2690.44, 2685.9, 2650.74; bar 119 is the first close below the tight-range floor 2665.14.", "Swing lows across the window: 2358.62 (bar 45), 2370.54 (bar 51), 2568.16 (bar 73), 2633.31 (bar 97), 2643.44 (bar 119); no close in bars 80-119 is below 2647.9 (bar 97).", "Optional non-price context: volume on bars 106-118 is mostly 1.9M-4.1M, the smallest cluster of the window versus 6M-10.7M during the bar 59-63 spike and 8.4M-10.2M during the bars 44-45 selloff; this is noted only as supplied context, not as confirmation."], "phase": "range", "primary_regime": "bull-trend", "role": "CONTEXT_ANALYST", "schema": "brooks.market-context.v2", "structures": [{"description": "Early wide two-sided range, bars 0-44: traded between the bar 14 low 2411.04 and the bar 40 high 2609.02; bar 20 was a one-bar spike (high 2680, low 2444.19, close 2555.52) that closed back inside, and bar 40 was a bear reversal bar (high 2609.02, low 2512.81, close 2514.07) that ended the advance. The range broke down at bar 45 to 2358.62.", "end_time_ms": 1789473599999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1788840000000, "upper_boundary": "2609.02"}, {"description": "Bull leg, bars 45-79: low 2358.62 to high 2850 (+20.8%). Composition is a five-bar spike (bars 59-63, open 2446.22 to close 2636.28) followed by a channel of overlapping bull bars whose pullback lows (2568.16 bar 73, 2641.7 bar 77) stayed above earlier swing lows.", "end_time_ms": 1789991999999, "kind": "swing", "lower_boundary": "2358.62", "start_time_ms": 1789488000000, "upper_boundary": "2850"}, {"description": "Post-spike trading range, bars 80-119 (40 bars): contained between the bar 97 low 2633.31 and the bar 82 high 2804.59, with the 2850 spike high (bar 79) at its origin. Bars overlap heavily, direction alternates, no close outside 2647.9-2775.61, and swing highs decline (2804.59, 2786.81, 2740.42).", "end_time_ms": 1790567999999, "kind": "range", "lower_boundary": "2633.31", "start_time_ms": 1789992000000, "upper_boundary": "2804.59"}, {"description": "Tight sub-range, bars 104-118 (15 bars): envelope 2665.14 (bar 112 low) to 2721.75 (bar 104 high); closes cluster between 2683.22 and 2717.24 with small overlapping bodies, the lowest-volume stretch of the window, i.e. a coiled range inside the wider range.", "end_time_ms": 1790553599999, "kind": "two-sided", "lower_boundary": "2665.14", "start_time_ms": 1790337600000, "upper_boundary": "2721.75"}, {"description": "Downside breakout attempt at bar 119 from the tight sub-range: opened 2685.9, broke the 2665.14 floor and closed 2650.74 near its low, below all bars 112-118 lows; the wider range floor 2633.31 (bar 97) was not reached, so the break is not yet accepted.", "end_time_ms": 1790567999999, "kind": "breakout", "lower_boundary": "2643.44", "start_time_ms": 1790553600000, "upper_boundary": "2697.14"}], "symbol": "ETH-USDT", "timeframe": "H4", "transition_conditions": ["Bear resolution: an H4 close below 2633.31 (bar 97 low) with a follow-through bar breaks the 40-bar range floor and the higher-low sequence, shifting the read to a bear leg inside a trading range; a close below 2568.16 (bar 73 low) would break the last higher low of the bull channel.", "Bull renewal: a bull bar closing back above 2721.75 (bar 104 high) and then above 2740.42 (bar 103 high) would mark a bull breakout from the tight range, restore an Always-In long bias and reopen the 2786.81-2804.59 zone.", "Continued overlapping bars with closes inside 2665.14-2721.75 keeps the phase a range and Always-In relevance low, regardless of the last bar's direction.", "Failed bear breakout: a bar closing back above 2665.14 after bar 119, especially a bull reversal bar closing near its high, would identify a failed downside breakout inside the range and return pressure to balanced."], "window_bars": 120}, "freshness": "current"}}, "raw": {"H1": [{"close": "2753.01", "close_time_ms": 1790146799999, "high": "2760.32", "low": "2750.87", "open": "2756.27", "open_time_ms": 1790143200000, "volume": "1578419.656"}, {"close": "2741.96", "close_time_ms": 1790150399999, "high": "2753.89", "low": "2737.35", "open": "2753.01", "open_time_ms": 1790146800